---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-navy text-paper/80 mt-32 no-print">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-16 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <div class="font-serif text-2xl text-paper tracking-tightest">Edu<span class="text-accent">·</span>Linker</div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm max-w-xs leading-relaxed">
        Infraštruktúra pre trh so znalosťami. Marketplace, FinTech jadro a Compliance Engine
        pre OP JAK a budúce európske programy.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-paper/45 leading-relaxed">
        v0.1 · ešte sa nám menia veci · ak nájdete chybu alebo nezrovnalosť,
        napíšte priamo: <a class="prose-link text-paper/80 hover:text-paper" href="mailto:patrik@edulinker.cz">patrik@edulinker.cz</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-paper text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] mb-4">Pre koho</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/pre-skoly" class="hover:text-paper">Pre školy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/pre-firmy" class="hover:text-paper">Pre firmy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/pre-lektorov" class="hover:text-paper">Pre lektorov</a></li>
        <li><a href="/cennik" class="hover:text-paper">Cenník</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-paper text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] mb-4">EduLinker</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="https://edulinker-academy.cz" class="hover:text-paper">↗ Academy (workshopy)</a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:patrik@edulinker.cz" class="hover:text-paper">patrik@edulinker.cz</a></li>
        <li class="text-paper/60">Brno · Juhomoravský kraj</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-paper/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:items-center sm:justify-between text-xs text-paper/45">
      <span>© {year} EduLinker s.r.o. · Postavené v Brne, otestované na vlastných školách.</span>
      <span>JIC Booster 2026 · MFF 2028–2034 ready</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
